{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_03_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d16fd07c45f3250a779fa1c07845eb79a27c06491e4fb222e41e1312c0fcfb5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd07b730d3259fce14c48ce671759a89a24ed2cdb24d0a857b7fc10d7be44269",
      "text": "四季，今天的补考……要是能及格就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b732c778bd9c7076630e32611c6989f6fbebfde19971e33db782f7d7f88476",
      "text": "是啊。\n要是能记住教给他的东西就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f0963e21fd42f03e923c85766a0a3fdfc44b6782963866d02a9460e2ab7fdf4",
      "text": "反正春名先生也去打工请假了，\n今天就先到此为止吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44f0c0153e50571fe209995206f74f5ad8cd96f98b062e58aab6fac490511cf3",
      "text": "我想再留下来写会儿歌。\n你们两个不用在意，先回去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0323532aa17ddf8597d8455d9c07bfcf61b4e75fe79a086cb3c3dea834b59b8",
      "text": "隼人也是，四季也是，春名也是……\n大家，都非常努力呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:268cd86f555f87704ec2b871d1fce75aaad5918d295c3d652af33d8d6783e8cd",
      "text": "啊，真是佩服他们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5a005f9198f6b87aefe08a13f36ace3afb2c39f2bddb61ff6aaa49077c80ad4",
      "text": "我也觉得，社团……很开心。\n比赛……虽然很紧张，但也想加油……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b8917364077153a0a65b3db3a68a314eae67f63f9e207e25b43b240119795d8",
      "text": "比赛啊。\n明明连曲子能不能赶出来都还不知道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29c267f9550f367676cb85775d3d518af4c85f48f2dc57a94b3cc26d26646181",
      "text": "夏来你也看了曲谱吧？\n上面明明还一片空白……哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_e:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52bd22a5fcd621d4c161cc2b58a301f3946fe04859d6a37100f7df770a76b012",
      "text": "（手机不见了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
